were built with the latest DP1 source tree, so if there are any
problems which have been fixed in -current it's an indication they
need to be merged.

Maintainers, please check the above list for ports you maintain: it's
quite common for ports which built fine on i386 to fail on alpha
because of code bugs.

Kris


